STEP 1 -- baseline, the feature is OFF: the DUT must not answer RADIUS      PASS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Method: no Local RADIUS Server is configured. The NAS sends one Access-Request to the
  DUT's vlan10 address. Expected (designed): no RADIUS reply at all.
  Capture on the box: tools/tb capture tb277 ckaaa eth3 20 t33407-off.pcap udp and port 1812
  or port 1813 or port 11812 or port 11813

tb277$ radsend 10.38.22.34 --port 1812 --secret testing123 --user testuser --password testing123 --bind 10.38.22.33 --timeout 3 --retries 1
