  => STEP 1 PASS: 3 Access-Requests left the box and 0 RADIUS packets came back. The DUT
     answered with ICMP port unreachable. That is positive proof: no process on the DUT is
     listening on UDP port 1812. Silence alone could also mean a lost packet, so this is the
     stronger result. The OFF baseline is now established at frame level.

